{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/051-di-dong/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/051-di-dong/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1/data.json","title":"詩集傳 · 蝃蝀在東莫之敢指女子有行遠父母兄弟 · 朱熹","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 蝃蝀 · 《詩集傳》关于“蝃蝀在東莫之敢指女子有行遠父母兄弟”的注脚：比也。蝃蝀、虹也。日與雨交、倐然成質。似有血氣之類。乃陰陽之氣、不當交而交者。蓋天地之淫氣也。在東者、莫虹也。虹隨日所映。故朝西而莫東也。○此刺…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"051-di-dong","materialId":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/051-di-dong/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","poem":{"id":"051-di-dong","title":"蝃蝀","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","蝃蝀"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"蝃蝀在東","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"莫之敢指","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"女子有行","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"遠父母兄弟","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"朝隮于西","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"崇朝其雨","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"女子有行","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"遠兄弟父母","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"乃如之人也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"懷昬姻也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"大無信也","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"不知命也","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009","title":"詩集傳","authors":["朱熹"],"contributorLine":"宋 · 朱熹","era":"宋","publicationYear":1186,"carrier":"TXT"},"annotation":{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"蝃蝀在東莫之敢指女子有行遠父母兄弟","targetNotes":"首章。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应维基文库《詩經集傳/卷之二》蝃蝀首章。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"朱熹","sectionLabel":null,"text":"比也。蝃蝀、虹也。日與雨交、倐然成質。似有血氣之類。乃陰陽之氣、不當交而交者。蓋天地之淫氣也。在東者、莫虹也。虹隨日所映。故朝西而莫東也。○此刺淫奔之詩。言蝃蝀在東、而人不敢指、以比淫奔之惡。人不可道。況女子有行、當遠其父母兄弟。豈可不顧此而冒行乎。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"蝃蝀在東莫之敢指女子有行遠父母兄弟","href":"/shijing/gloss/051-di-dong/zhuxi-shijichuan-kr1c0009/0001-1","isCurrent"